{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Soviet Survival",
    "steam_appid": 3603940,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soviet Survival</strong> is an isometric, open-world survival game where you must find your place in the ruined Soviet Union.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive in this merciless new reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Survive at all costs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt or take risks in the ruins of the old world, getting rare supplies. The choice is yours: hide and build or take risks in search of a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Cooperative mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with friends. Together, survivors are stronger, but you can't trust everyone...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Leveling and loot system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with skills and Soviet equipment. From a sawed-off shotgun to an AK-47 - choose a weapon and survival style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Crafting and construction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create everything from homemade weapons to fortified shelters. Strengthen your positions and defend yourself from threats, be it hungry beasts, mutants or marauders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Infected trees</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting wood is not that easy since all the trees are infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Realistic fight for life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst and radioactive zones \u2013 even without mutants and bandits, this world will try to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you hold out in a world where hope is a scarce commodity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soviet Survival is your story in a harsh alternative reality. Are you ready to fight?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soviet Survival</strong> is an isometric, open-world survival game where you must find your place in the ruined Soviet Union.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive in this merciless new reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Survive at all costs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt or take risks in the ruins of the old world, getting rare supplies. The choice is yours: hide and build or take risks in search of a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Cooperative mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with friends. Together, survivors are stronger, but you can't trust everyone...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Leveling and loot system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with skills and Soviet equipment. From a sawed-off shotgun to an AK-47 - choose a weapon and survival style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Crafting and construction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create everything from homemade weapons to fortified shelters. Strengthen your positions and defend yourself from threats, be it hungry beasts, mutants or marauders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Infected trees</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting wood is not that easy since all the trees are infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Realistic fight for life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst and radioactive zones \u2013 even without mutants and bandits, this world will try to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you hold out in a world where hope is a scarce commodity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soviet Survival is your story in a harsh alternative reality. Are you ready to fight?</p>",
    "short_description": "Soviet Survival is an isometric, open-world survival game where you must find your place in the ruined Soviet Union.",
